{
  "headline": "FDA records show the linezolid supply is manufactured at Alkem Laboratories Limited (FEI 3006370524) with the most recent inspection classified VAI on 2018-03-27",
  "headline_cites": ["E7", "E6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The drug label for NDC 67877041920 identifies Alkem Laboratories Limited as the manufacturing plant (FEI 3006370524) for linezolid supplied to both Corvale sites.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for this facility show a series of Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI) classifications, with the most recent inspection ending 2018-03-27 and known to FDA by 2018-06-25.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No FDA inspection records after 2018-03-27 are provided in the evidence, and the label registration lists the last inspection as NAI on 2019-08-30 without a corresponding FDA inspection record in the supplied data.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E3", "E4", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 76 units at 14.4 per day, giving 5 days on hand, while Corvale General holds 388 units at 16.1 per day, giving 24 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 127 units from Corvale General to Corvale East would leave Corvale General with approximately 14 days on hand and bring Corvale East to approximately 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the evidence links are weak and no recent FDA inspection or shortage cause is documented, verify current FDA inspection status for FEI 3006370524 and confirm allocation availability with both sites before executing the transfer.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7"]
    }
  ]
}
